<Program Use="Target" Name="S01_SDCServoPNP" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="R00_Main" Disabled="false" Class="Standard" UseAsFolder="false">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Generated by JARVIS v1.1.1 (2026-08-20) — SDC State Logic Builder
S01 SDC Servo PNP - HorizontalAxis + VerticalAxis servo pick and place, timer-only gripper. VerticalAxis Slow=AutoSpeed[0] (13/19/28/37) and Fast=AutoSpeed[1] (7/10/22/34/40/100) staged on dedicated profile rungs; HorizontalAxis runs Fast=AutoSpeed[1]. Wideband blends on Z retract and slow-up corners; strict in-position on descents, grip and release. Recovery: init block 100-124 clears Z first, part-held decision at state 4.]]>
</Description>
